  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.172` to `4.1.173`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.172...application_builder_helpers/4.1.173)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): use absolute columns for two-column help continuations (Fixes #763) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/773\n* fix(cli): keep --version transparent to live help-target resolution (Fixes #761) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/776\n* fix(cli): bind parser defaults for omitted optional options (Fixes #762) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/777\n* fix(cli): keep grouping-parent typo errors ahead of the abstract version shortcut (Fixes #760) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/775\n* Bump Microsoft.AspNetCore.SignalR.Common from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/746\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261027103228.24626ab...build.20261028215112.4edf0d5",
